lvp-cs2-trace v6: env-gated LVP_CS2_TRACE instrumentation for CS2 boot debug.
v6: no texture_map inside command execution any more. v4/v5 hashed attachments
at END_RENDERING and imgop sources/destinations mid-execution; mapping render
targets from the queue thread stalls the game's loader (map load hangs at the
loading screen, engine trickles ~1 frame/40s; trace off loads in ~20s).
Counters and metadata logs stay; only hash_sw still maps, at submit end.
v5: hash_imgop only considered registry swapchain images (use-after-free fix).
